{
    "title": "Hearthstone",
    "description": "Welcome to Hearthstone, the strategy card game that\u2019s easy to learn but impossible to put down! Play for FREE and complete quests to earn free rewards!* \r\n\r\nFrom the studio that brought you World of Warcraft\u00ae, Overwatch\u00ae and Diablo Immortal\u00ae, comes HEARTHSTONE\u00ae, Blizzard Entertainment\u2019s award-winning CCG - play on your phone, tablet or PC! \r\n\r\nCollect powerful battle cards and create a mighty deck! Summon minions and sling aoe spells to seize control of ever-shifting battle arenas. Wield a masterful strategy and outwit all players who dare challenge you. Each playable Hearthstone class has a unique hero power and their own set of special class cards.\r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s your deck builder  strategy? Do you play aggressive and rush your enemy with minions or do you take your time and build powerful cards? What class will you choose?\r\nChannel powerful magic spells as a Mage or cut through enemy minions as a Rogue.\r\n\r\nPlay cards your way - Hearthstone has a game mode for everyone!\r\n\r\nHearthstone - choose between Standard, Wild, and Casual\r\n\u25cf\tStandard mode PvP fun and PvE challenges!\r\n\u25cf\tCraft decks and test your skills to climb to the top of the ranks\r\n\u25cf\tRanked matches or friendly challenges\r\n\r\nBattlegrounds mode to play with friends - Enter a battle arena ,  8 people enter 1 person leaves victorious\r\n\u25cf\tEasy to learn; difficult to master \r\n\u25cf\tMajor game changer  to the auto battler genre \r\n\u25cf\tAuto Battler with tons of different heroes to choose from\r\n\u25cf\tRecruit minions and watch them fight \r\n\r\nTavern Brawl\r\n\u25cf\tJump in for a low stake, wacky rumble in these rule-bending limited-time events! \r\n\u25cf\tEvery week, there\u2019s a new set of rules and another prize to collect.\r\n\r\nMore fun ways to play \r\n\u25cf\tPVE - Solo adventures to practice and hone your skills or just play for weekly quests!\r\n\u25cf\tReturning player? Wild mode lets you play all of your cards!\r\n\r\nDescend into the WARCRAFT UNIVERSE Explore iconic locations from the beloved Warcraft universe as you master your deck, collect cards, and assemble powerful combos.\r\n\r\nBattle with your favorite Warcraft heroes! There\u2019s no shortage of Heroes in the world of Azeroth:\r\n\u25cf\tLich King \r\n\u25cf\tIllidan Stormrage\r\n\u25cf\tThrall\r\n\u25cf\tJaina Proudmore\r\n\u25cf\tGarrosh Hellscream and more\r\n\r\nEach class has a unique Hero Power that captures their identity and fuels their strategy\r\n\u25cf\tDeath Knight: Fallen champions of the Scourge who  harness three powerful Runes\r\n\u25cf\tWarlock: Call on nightmarish Demons for aid and get power at any cost\r\n\u25cf\tRogue: Subtle and evasive assassins\r\n\u25cf\tMage: Masters of arcane, fire and frost\r\n\u25cf\tDemon Hunter: Agile fighters who call upon demonic allies and fel magic\r\n\u25cf\tPaladin: Stalwart champions of the Light\r\n\u25cf\tPlay as a Druid, Hunter, Priest, Shaman or Warrior too!\r\n\r\nBattle with Your Own Deck Build a deck from scratch, copy a friend\u2019s list, or jump right in with a prebuilt deck. You can customize your decks to get your list just right.\r\n\r\nWhat is your deck building strategy?\r\n\u25cf\tEnjoy premade decks to quickly join the Ranked ladder\r\n\u25cf\tBuild a deck from scratch or copy a friend\u2019s list\r\n\u25cf\tCustomize your decks to get your list just right\r\n\r\nTrade cards for dust in game to craft new legendary cards!\r\n\r\nExperience the magic, mischief and mayhem in this epic CCG!  Battle with friends and join the millions of players around the hearth to enjoy Hearthstone, and PLAY TODAY!\r\n\r\n*In-game purchases are optional.\r\n\r\n\u00a92024 Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. Hearthstone, World of Warcraft, Overwatch, Diablo Immortal, and Blizzard Entertainment are trademarks or registered trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Hearthstone, the strategy card game that\u2019s easy to learn but impossible to put down! Play for FREE and complete quests to earn free rewards!* <br><br>From the studio that brought you World of Warcraft\u00ae, Overwatch\u00ae and Diablo Immortal\u00ae, comes HEARTHSTONE\u00ae, Blizzard Entertainment\u2019s award-winning CCG - play on your phone, tablet or PC! <br><br>Collect powerful battle cards and create a mighty deck! Summon minions and sling aoe spells to seize control of ever-shifting battle arenas. Wield a masterful strategy and outwit all players who dare challenge you. Each playable Hearthstone class has a unique hero power and their own set of special class cards.<br><br>What\u2019s your deck builder  strategy? Do you play aggressive and rush your enemy with minions or do you take your time and build powerful cards? What class will you choose?<br>Channel powerful magic spells as a Mage or cut through enemy minions as a Rogue.<br><br>Play cards your way - Hearthstone has a game mode for everyone!<br><br>Hearthstone - choose between Standard, Wild, and Casual<br>\u25cf\tStandard mode PvP fun and PvE challenges!<br>\u25cf\tCraft decks and test your skills to climb to the top of the ranks<br>\u25cf\tRanked matches or friendly challenges<br><br>Battlegrounds mode to play with friends - Enter a battle arena ,  8 people enter 1 person leaves victorious<br>\u25cf\tEasy to learn; difficult to master <br>\u25cf\tMajor game changer  to the auto battler genre <br>\u25cf\tAuto Battler with tons of different heroes to choose from<br>\u25cf\tRecruit minions and watch them fight <br><br>Tavern Brawl<br>\u25cf\tJump in for a low stake, wacky rumble in these rule-bending limited-time events! <br>\u25cf\tEvery week, there\u2019s a new set of rules and another prize to collect.<br><br>More fun ways to play <br>\u25cf\tPVE - Solo adventures to practice and hone your skills or just play for weekly quests!<br>\u25cf\tReturning player? Wild mode lets you play all of your cards!<br><br>Descend into the WARCRAFT UNIVERSE Explore iconic locations from the beloved Warcraft universe as you master your deck, collect cards, and assemble powerful combos.<br><br>Battle with your favorite Warcraft heroes! There\u2019s no shortage of Heroes in the world of Azeroth:<br>\u25cf\tLich King <br>\u25cf\tIllidan Stormrage<br>\u25cf\tThrall<br>\u25cf\tJaina Proudmore<br>\u25cf\tGarrosh Hellscream and more<br><br>Each class has a unique Hero Power that captures their identity and fuels their strategy<br>\u25cf\tDeath Knight: Fallen champions of the Scourge who  harness three powerful Runes<br>\u25cf\tWarlock: Call on nightmarish Demons for aid and get power at any cost<br>\u25cf\tRogue: Subtle and evasive assassins<br>\u25cf\tMage: Masters of arcane, fire and frost<br>\u25cf\tDemon Hunter: Agile fighters who call upon demonic allies and fel magic<br>\u25cf\tPaladin: Stalwart champions of the Light<br>\u25cf\tPlay as a Druid, Hunter, Priest, Shaman or Warrior too!<br><br>Battle with Your Own Deck Build a deck from scratch, copy a friend\u2019s list, or jump right in with a prebuilt deck. You can customize your decks to get your list just right.<br><br>What is your deck building strategy?<br>\u25cf\tEnjoy premade decks to quickly join the Ranked ladder<br>\u25cf\tBuild a deck from scratch or copy a friend\u2019s list<br>\u25cf\tCustomize your decks to get your list just right<br><br>Trade cards for dust in game to craft new legendary cards!<br><br>Experience the magic, mischief and mayhem in this epic CCG!  Battle with friends and join the millions of players around the hearth to enjoy Hearthstone, and PLAY TODAY!<br><br>*In-game purchases are optional.<br><br>\u00a92024 Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. Hearthstone, World of Warcraft, Overwatch, Diablo Immortal, and Blizzard Entertainment are trademarks or registered trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.",
